<p>Save your usual size and read on this device. The ticket opens with them when the debate starts; you still confirm each answer.</p>
<fieldset class="stake-size">
<legend>Size · each contract pays 0–1 YC</legend>
<div class="stake-chips">
<button type="button" data-stake-ready-size="5" aria-pressed="false">5</button>
<button type="button" data-stake-ready-size="10" aria-pressed="true">10</button>
<button type="button" data-stake-ready-size="25" aria-pressed="false">25</button>
<button type="button" data-stake-ready-size="50" aria-pressed="false">50</button>
<button type="button" data-stake-ready-size="100" aria-pressed="false">100</button>
</div>
<label class="stake-size-input">Contracts<input name="size" inputmode="numeric" value="10" autocomplete="off" required>
</label>
</fieldset>
<label class="stake-read">Your usual read: what share will say yes?<span class="stake-read-row">
<input type="range" name="read" min="1" max="99" step="1" value="50">
<output data-stake-ready-read-out>50%</output>
</span>
</label>
<button type="submit" class="stake-ready-save">Save on this device</button>
<p class="stake-ready-note" data-stake-ready-note role="status" aria-live="polite">
</p>
</form>
<form class="stake-ticket" data-stake-ticket hidden>
<fieldset class="stake-size">
<legend>Size · each contract pays 0–1 YC</legend>
<div class="stake-chips">
<button type="button" data-stake-size="5" aria-pressed="false">5</button>
<button type="button" data-stake-size="10" aria-pressed="true">10</button>
<button type="button" data-stake-size="25" aria-pressed="false">25</button>
<button type="button" data-stake-size="50" aria-pressed="false">50</button>
<button type="button" data-stake-size="100" aria-pressed="false">100</button>
</div>
<label class="stake-size-input">Contracts<input name="size" inputmode="numeric" value="10" autocomplete="off" required>
</label>
</fieldset>
<label class="stake-read" data-stake-read-wrap>What share will say yes this turn?<span class="stake-read-row">
<input type="range" name="read" min="1" max="99" step="1" value="50">
<output data-stake-read-out>50%</output>
</span>
</label>
<p class="stake-ceiling" data-stake-ceiling>
</p>
<details class="stake-advanced" data-stake-advanced>
<summary>Set a maximum price instead</summary>
<label>Maximum price per contract (0.01–0.99 YC)<input name="ceiling" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" placeholder="0.50">
</label>
</details>
<dl class="stake-terms">
<div>
<dt>Reserved now</dt>
<dd data-stake-term="reserved">
</dd>
</div>
<div>
<dt>Most you can lose</dt>
<dd data-stake-term="lose">
</dd>
</div>
<div>
<dt>You get back</dt>
<dd data-stake-term="back">
</dd>
</div>
<div>
<dt>Fee</dt>
<dd>None</dd>
</div>
<div>
<dt>Results</dt>
<dd data-stake-term="results">
</dd>
</div>
</dl>
<label class="stake-review-choice">
<input type="checkbox" data-stake-review-choice> Review in a pop-up before placing</label>
<p class="stake-error" data-stake-error role="alert">
</p>
<button type="submit" class="stake-confirm" data-stake-confirm>
</button>
<p class="stake-final">Final once placed. Yap Coins are play money with no cash value.</p>
</form>
<div class="stake-receipt" data-stake-receipt hidden>
</div>
<p class="stake-balance" data-stake-balance>
</p>
<p class="stake-signin" data-stake-signin hidden>
<a href="/account?next=%2Fdebates%2Fpublic-debate">Sign in to answer →</a>
</p>
<section class="stake-results" data-stake-results aria-labelledby="stake-results-title" hidden>
<h3 id="stake-results-title" data-stake-results-title>
</h3>
<ul data-stake-results-list>
</ul>
</section>
<details class="stake-positions" data-stake-positions-wrap hidden>
<summary>Your positions <span data-stake-positions-count>
</span>
</summary>
<ul data-stake-positions>
</ul>
</details>
<dialog class="information-card stake-review" data-stake-review aria-labelledby="stake-review-title">
<h2 id="stake-review-title">Review your position</h2>
<dl class="stake-terms" data-stake-review-terms>
</dl>
<p>Final once placed. You can't edit or cancel it.</p>
<div class="stake-review-actions">
<button type="button" class="button" data-stake-review-place>Place it</button>
<button type="button" data-stake-review-back>Back</button>
</div>
</dialog>
</section>\\n      <section class="arena-panel arena-info-card" aria-labelledby="arena-info-title">
<h2 id="arena-info-title">About this debate</h2>
<dl class="arena-info">
<div>
<dt>Debate</dt>
<dd>Upcoming</dd>
</div>
<div>
<dt>Scheduled</dt>
<dd>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 17:00:00 GMT</dd>
</div>
<div>
<dt>Rules version</dt>
<dd>preview-1</dd>
</div>
<div>
<dt>How results work</dt>
<dd>Each turn, a Yes contract pays the share of people who said yes, and a No contract the share who said no. Every answer counts once, whatever its size.</dd>
</div>
</dl>
<p class="arena-info-note">The chart shows each turn's share of yes answers once its results are revealed.</p>
</section>\\n      <section class="arena-panel arena-sentiment">
<h2>Latest result <small data-arena-sentiment-caption>Latest revealed round</small>
</h2>
<div class="arena-sentiment-bar" role="img" aria-label="No settled endorsement share yet" data-arena-sentiment-bar data-empty="true">
<span>
</span>
</div>
<div class="arena-sentiment-values">
<strong class="yes" data-arena-yes>—</strong>
<strong class="no" data-arena-no>—</strong>
</div>
<p data-arena-scope>Human rounds and private bot sandboxes are shown separately.</p>
</section>\\n      <p class="arena-disclosure">Yap Coins are play money with no cash value.</p>\\n    </aside>\\n    <script type="module" src="/assets/a4-inline.js?v=0123456789ab">
</script>\\n    <script type="module" src="/assets/arena.js?v=0123456789ab">
</script>
<script type="module" src="/assets/stake-panel.js?v=0123456789ab">
</script>
<script type="module" src="/assets/media.bundle.js?v=0123456789ab">
</script>
<script type="module" src="/assets/community.js?v=0123456789ab">
</script>\\n  </div>
</main>
<footer class="site-footer">
<div class="container footer-inner">
<span>YAP ARENA <span class="muted">/ Ideas under pressure.</span>
</span>
<span>
<a href="/topics">Topics</a> · <a href="/coins">Yap Coins</a> · <a href="/about">About</a> · Play money</span>
</div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
`;

