<p class="stake-status" data-stake-status role="status" aria-live="polite">Checking this debate's Yap Coins rounds…</p>
<h2 class="stake-question" id="stake-question">Do you agree?</h2>
<p class="stake-proposition">“Should we debate this?”</p>
