<main id="main">
<section class="container page-intro">
<span class="eyebrow accent">ABOUT YAP ARENA</span>
<h1>Make room for<br>
<em>the other side.</em>
</h1>
<p>YAP Arena is building a home for live debates and the ideas that connect them.</p>
</section>
<section class="container about-copy">
<h2>What you can explore now</h2>
<p>This public preview shows published topics, debate listings, and participant profiles. Sign in to pick your handle and follow people or topics. Listings marked Demo are fictional examples used to develop and test the product.</p>
<p>Live video and replay are available in a configured local prototype. A listing’s status does not prove that video is available or that a result has been determined. Yap Coins and labeled bot rounds are available when enabled. Real funds remain unavailable.</p>
<h2 id="measurement">Optional usage measurement</h2>
<p>We ask before recording discovery pages, watch time, replay starts, matching, follows, reports, or return visits. If you allow it, we use a random browser cookie, not your wallet address, and may associate events with your signed-in account to separate founder-affiliated activity. We do not store search text, chat text, IP addresses, or wallet addresses in product events. Use Measurement settings in the footer to turn it off and delete your measurements. Raw events and watch sessions are retained for up to 90 days; an unused consent expires after 180 days. Debate completion is counted from public event state without a browser identifier.</p>
<a class="button" href="/debates">Explore debates ↗</a>
</section>
</main>
<footer class="site-footer">
<div class="container footer-inner">
<span>YAP ARENA <span class="muted">/ Ideas under pressure.</span>
</span>
<span>
<a href="/topics">Topics</a> · <a href="/coins">Yap Coins</a> · <a href="/about">About</a> · Play money</span>
</div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
`;

