<span class="eyebrow">02 / CHALLENGE A PERSON</span>
<h2>Pick an opponent</h2>
<form id="challenge-create" class="stack-form">
<label>Opponent<input name="targetHandle" list="people-options" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" placeholder="Search by handle or name" required>
</label>
<datalist id="people-options">
</datalist>
<label>Published topic slug<input name="topicSlug" pattern="[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]{2,79}" required>
</label>
<label>Proposition<input name="proposition" minlength="10" maxlength="240" required>
</label>
<label>Your side<select name="requestedSide">
<option value="A">Side A</option>
<option value="B">Side B</option>
</select>
</label>
<fieldset class="choice-group">
<legend>When</legend>
<label>
<input type="radio" name="mode" value="now" checked> Now</label>
<label>
<input type="radio" name="mode" value="scheduled"> Propose times</label>
</fieldset>
<div class="challenge-times" data-challenge-times hidden>
<label>First choice, your local time<input name="time1" type="datetime-local">
</label>
<label>Second choice (optional)<input name="time2" type="datetime-local">
</label>
<label>Third choice (optional)<input name="time3" type="datetime-local">
</label>
</div>
<button class="button" type="submit">Send challenge ↗</button>
</form>
<p class="form-note">Now: if they're online, they have 2 minutes to answer; otherwise the challenge waits for them. Proposed times must be 1 hour to 90 days ahead. Unanswered challenges expire after 7 days.</p>
</section>
</div>
<div class="match-grid">
<section class="information-card">
<span class="eyebrow">DEBATE NOW</span>
<h2>Live queue</h2>
<p>Open a <a href="/topics">topic</a> and queue on a side. You are matched with someone on the other side in seconds.</p>
</section>
<section class="information-card">
<span class="eyebrow">YOUR CHALLENGES</span>
<h2>Answer or follow up</h2>
