<strong>BASIC INCOME</strong>
<span class="ya-down">46% ↘ 4 pp</span>
</button>
</div>\\n  <main id="main" class="ya-content">\\n    <div class="ya-heading">
<div>
<h1>Where ideas move.</h1>
<p>Follow an idea. Hear both sides. Take a position.</p>
</div>
<span class="ya-concept">Concept · Sample data</span>
</div>\\n    <section class="ya-carousel" id="ya-carousel" aria-label="Trending ideas" aria-roledescription="carousel">\\n    <div class="ya-carousel-window" id="ya-carousel-window">
<div class="ya-layout" id="ya-trending-slide" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="1 of 6: AI models should be open source.">\\n      <aside class="ya-arguments" id="ya-arguments" aria-label="Arguments behind the trending idea">
<div class="ya-arguments-head">
<h3>Behind the position</h3>
<button type="button" class="ya-arguments-toggle cursor-interaction" id="ya-arguments-toggle" aria-label="Pause argument flow" aria-pressed="false">Ⅱ</button>
</div>
<div class="ya-arguments-window" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Argument stream. Scroll or use arrow keys to browse.">
<div class="ya-argument-track" id="ya-argument-track" data-idea="ai">
<ul class="ya-argument-list">
<li class="ya-argument-item">
<div class="ya-argument-stance ">FOR THE IDEA</div>
<p class="ya-argument-text">Open models let independent researchers audit safety and bias.</p>
<div class="ya-argument-endorsement">
<span>Endorse this argument</span>
<strong>79%</strong>
</div>
<div class="ya-argument-meter" aria-hidden="true">
<span style="width:79%">
</span>
</div>
</li>
<li class="ya-argument-item">
<div class="ya-argument-stance against">COUNTERARGUMENT</div>
<p class="ya-argument-text">Open weights can put dangerous capabilities in the wrong hands.</p>
<div class="ya-argument-endorsement">
<span>Endorse this argument</span>
<strong>58%</strong>
</div>
<div class="ya-argument-meter" aria-hidden="true">
<span style="width:58%">
</span>
</div>
</li>
<li class="ya-argument-item">
<div class="ya-argument-stance ">FOR THE IDEA</div>
<p class="ya-argument-text">Smaller teams should be able to build on the same foundations.</p>
<div class="ya-argument-endorsement">
<span>Endorse this argument</span>
<strong>76%</strong>
</div>
<div class="ya-argument-meter" aria-hidden="true">
<span style="width:76%">
</span>
</div>
</li>
<li class="ya-argument-item">
<div class="ya-argument-stance against">COUNTERARGUMENT</div>
<p class="ya-argument-text">Who takes responsibility when an open model causes harm?</p>
<div class="ya-argument-endorsement">
<span>Endorse this argument</span>
<strong>51%</strong>
</div>
<div class="ya-argument-meter" aria-hidden="true">
<span style="width:51%">
</span>
</div>
</li>
<li class="ya-argument-item">
<div class="ya-argument-stance ">FOR THE IDEA</div>
