</svg>
</button>
</div>\\n  </article>
</div>
</section>
<section class="container section">
<div class="section-heading">
<div>
<span class="eyebrow">02 / EXPLORE IDEAS</span>
<h2>Topics in play</h2>
</div>
<a class="text-link" href="/topics">All topics <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
</a>
</div>
<div class="card-grid">
<article class="topic-card">
<span class="eyebrow">TOPIC </span>
<h3>
<a href="/topics/public-topic">Public topic</a>
</h3>
<p>A question worth debating.</p>
<div class="topic-sides">
<span>For</span>
<span>Against</span>
</div>
</article>
<article class="topic-card">
<span class="eyebrow">TOPIC · DEMO</span>
<h3>
<a href="/topics/hostile-topic">Topic &lt;b&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/b&gt; &quot;quoted&quot; &#39;single&#39; &amp; &lt;</a>
</h3>
<p>Summary &lt;b&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/b&gt; &quot;quoted&quot; &#39;single&#39; &amp; &lt;</p>
<div class="topic-sides">
<span>Side A &lt;b&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/b&gt; &quot;quoted&quot; &#39;single&#39; &amp; &lt;</span>
<span>Side B &lt;b&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/b&gt; &quot;quoted&quot; &#39;single&#39; &amp; &lt;</span>
</div>
</article>
</div>
</section>
<section class="container note-band">
<span class="eyebrow">ABOUT THIS PREVIEW</span>
<p>YAP Arena is under development. Demo listings are examples, not real events. Profiles, wallet sign-in, and follows are available. Live debate and replay require configured media. Yap Coins and labeled bot rounds are available when enabled; real funds are unavailable.</p>
</section>
<script type="module" src="/assets/hero-preview.js?v=0123456789ab">
</script>
</main>
<footer class="site-footer">
<div class="container footer-inner">
<span>YAP ARENA <span class="muted">/ Ideas under pressure.</span>
</span>
<span>
<a href="/topics">Topics</a> · <a href="/coins">Yap Coins</a> · <a href="/about">About</a> · Play money</span>
</div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
`;

exports[`renders the measurement dashboard 1`] = `
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Product measurement · YAP Arena</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/site.css?v=0123456789ab">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/site-header.css?v=0123456789ab">
<script defer src="/assets/session-coordination.js?v=0123456789ab">
</script>
<script defer src="/assets/site.js?v=0123456789ab">
</script>
<script defer src="/assets/account-balance.js?v=0123456789ab">
</script>
<script type="module" src="/assets/site-header.js?v=0123456789ab">
</script>
<script defer src="/assets/measurement-dashboard.js?v=0123456789ab">
</script>
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<header class="site-header" data-site-header data-session="checking">\\n    <div class="container nav arena-nav">\\n      <a class="brand" href="/home" aria-label="YAP Arena home">
<svg class="arena-brand-symbol" viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true">
<ellipse cx="20" cy="20" rx="13" ry="16" transform="rotate(30 20 20)"/>
<path d="M9 35 31 5"/>
</svg>
<span>YAP ARENA</span>
</a>\\n      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
<a href="/live">Live</a>
<a href="/debates">Explore</a>
<a href="/match">Create</a>
</nav>\\n      <form class="arena-header-search" action="/debates" method="get" role="search">
<label class="sr-only" for="header-search">Search debates</label>
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
<circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5"/>
<path d="m16 16 5 5"/>
</svg>
<input id="header-search" type="search" name="q" maxlength="80" placeholder="Search debates…">
<button type="submit" class="sr-only">Search</button>
</form>\\n      <div class="arena-header-account">\\n        <span data-header-checking class="header-session-loading" role="status">
<span class="sr-only">Checking your account…</span>
</span>\\n        <div class="header-auth-actions" data-header-guest hidden>
<a class="header-signup" href="/account" data-header-sign-in>Sign in</a>
</div>\\n        <button class="header-retry" type="button" data-header-retry hidden>Retry account</button>\\n        <div class="header-member-actions" data-header-member hidden>\\n          <details class="arena-wallet-menu">
<summary aria-label="Yap Coins balance and actions">
<span class="header-balance-label">Balance</span>
<strong data-header-balance>—</strong>
<span class="arena-chevron" aria-hidden="true">⌄</span>
</summary>
<div class="arena-wallet-popover">
<strong data-header-balance-heading>Your Yap Coins</strong>
<span data-header-reserved>Checking balance…</span>
<a href="/coins" data-header-balances-link>Balances &amp; activity →</a>
</div>
</details>\\n          <details class="header-user-menu">
<summary class="arena-avatar" data-header-account aria-label="Open account menu">
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true">
<circle cx="12" cy="8" r="3.5"/>
<path d="M5 21v-2a7 7 0 0 1 14 0v2"/>
</svg>
</summary>
<div class="header-user-popover">
<span class="header-menu-caption" data-header-identity>
<span>YOUR ACCOUNT</span>
</span>
<a href="/account#profile" data-header-profile-link>Your profile</a>
<a href="/account">Settings</a>
<a href="/coins">Yap Coins</a>
<button type="button" data-header-logout>Sign out <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
</button>
</div>
</details>\\n        </div>\\n        <noscript>
<div class="header-auth-actions">
<a class="header-login" href="/api/auth/login?connection=google">Continue with Google</a>
<a class="header-signup" href="/api/auth/login?connection=email">Continue with email</a>
</div>
</noscript>\\n      </div>\\n      <p class="sr-only" role="status" data-header-status>
</p>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>
<main id="main" class="container section">
<div class="section-heading">
<div>
<span class="eyebrow">OPERATIONS</span>
<h1>Product measurement</h1>
</div>
</div>
<p>Last 28 days, UTC. These are consented browser or account events except debate completion, which comes from the authoritative event transition. Unclassified activity is never treated as independent. Demo events are excluded.</p>
<p>Counts are actions or browser sessions, not unique people. A wallet is not a person. The proposed 28-day returning participant rate and 30% hypothesis are not approved success or launch gates.</p>
<div class="information-card">
<h2>Discover, match, finish, return</h2>
<div class="table-scroll">
<table>
<caption>Product events by reviewed affiliation</caption>
<thead>
<tr>
<th scope="col">Measure</th>
<th scope="col">Independent</th>
<th scope="col">Founder-affiliated</th>
<th scope="col">Unclassified</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Discovery views</th>
<td>0</td>
<td>0</td>
<td>0</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Match requests opened</th>
<td>0</td>
<td>0</td>
<td>0</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Matches accepted</th>
<td>0</td>
<td>0</td>
<td>0</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Debates completed</th>
<td>0</td>
<td>0</td>
<td>0</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Replay starts</th>
<td>0</td>
<td>0</td>
<td>0</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Follows created</th>
<td>0</td>
<td>0</td>
<td>0</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Reports submitted</th>
<td>0</td>
<td>0</td>
<td>0</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Different debate or topic returns</th>
<td>0</td>
<td>0</td>
<td>0</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Live watch minutes</th>
<td>0</td>
<td>0</td>
<td>0</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Replay watch minutes</th>
<td>0</td>
<td>0</td>
<td>0</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div class="information-card">
<h2>Review account affiliation</h2>
<p>Classify only accounts whose relationship to the founder has been checked. Unknown accounts stay unclassified. Every change keeps an internal audit entry.</p>
<form id="affiliation-form" class="stack-form">
<label>Published profile handle<input name="handle" minlength="3" maxlength="40" required>
</label>
<label>Classification<select name="affiliation" required>
<option value="">Select classification</option>
<option value="founder">Founder-affiliated</option>
<option value="independent">Independent</option>
<option value="unclassified">Remove classification</option>
</select>
</label>
<label>Review reason<textarea name="reason" minlength="10" maxlength="500" rows="3" required>
</textarea>
</label>
<button type="submit">Save review</button>
<p id="affiliation-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">
</p>
</form>
<div class="table-scroll">
<table>
<caption>Recent reviewed classifications</caption>
<thead>
<tr>
<th scope="col">Profile</th>
<th scope="col">Classification</th>
<th scope="col">Reason</th>
<th scope="col">Updated UTC</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td colspan="4">No accounts classified yet.</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<p>
<a href="/api/measurement/dashboard">Download dashboard data as JSON</a> · <a href="/home">Back to home</a>
</p>
</main>
<footer class="site-footer">
<div class="container footer-inner">Measurement preview · No financial activity</div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
`;

